<view class="page-shell merchant-settings-page">
  <view wx:if="{{unavailable}}" class="save-tip">店铺设置、配送区域和操作日志接口暂未接入，生产环境已禁用保存操作。</view>
  <view class="settings-heading"><view class="section-title">店铺设置</view><view class="muted-text">调整后会立即影响顾客端展示</view></view>
  <view class="settings-card card"><view class="settings-row settings-row--switch"><view><view class="settings-label">营业状态</view><view class="settings-help">暂停后不能创建新订单，旧订单仍可处理</view></view><switch checked="{{isOpen}}" color="#2e6b4f" bindchange="toggleOpen" /></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="form-group"><view class="form-label">店铺公告</view><input class="form-input" value="{{form.announcement}}" maxlength="50" placeholder="给顾客的一句话" bindinput="onAnnouncementInput" /></view><view class="form-group"><view class="form-label">门店联系电话</view><input class="form-input" value="{{form.phone}}" type="number" maxlength="11" bindinput="onPhoneInput" /></view><view class="form-group"><view class="form-label">默认跑腿费（元）</view><view class="fee-editor"><view class="fee-button" bindtap="changeFee" data-delta="-1">−</view><view class="fee-value">{{deliveryFeeYuan}}</view><view class="fee-button" bindtap="changeFee" data-delta="1">+</view></view></view></view>
  <view class="settings-card card"><view class="form-group"><view class="form-label">营业时间说明（展示用，开关控制接单）</view><input class="form-input" value="{{form.businessHours}}" bindinput="onHoursInput" /></view><view class="form-group"><view class="form-label">外卖默认起送价（元）</view><input class="form-input" type="digit" value="{{minGoodsAmount}}" bindinput="onMinimumInput" /></view></view>
  <view class="settings-card card"><view class="settings-row settings-row--switch"><view><view class="settings-label">冷吃快递</view><view class="settings-help">暂停后冷吃商品不能创建新订单，已支付订单仍可发货</view></view><switch checked="{{courierOpen}}" color="#a34f50" bindchange="toggleCourier" /></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="form-row"><view class="form-group form-group--half"><view class="form-label">默认快递费（元）</view><input class="form-input" type="digit" value="{{shippingFeeYuan}}" bindinput="onShippingFeeInput" /></view><view class="form-group form-group--half"><view class="form-label">包邮门槛（元）</view><input class="form-input" type="digit" value="{{freeShippingYuan}}" bindinput="onFreeShippingInput" /></view></view><view class="form-row"><view class="form-group form-group--half"><view class="form-label">冷吃起购金额（元）</view><input class="form-input" type="digit" value="{{courierMinGoodsAmount}}" bindinput="onCourierMinimumInput" /></view><view class="form-group form-group--half"><view class="form-label">默认快递公司</view><input class="form-input" value="{{shippingCarrier}}" maxlength="40" placeholder="例如：中通快递" bindinput="onShippingCarrierInput" /></view></view><view class="settings-help">包邮门槛填 0 表示不包邮；金额均按商品小计计算，快递费由顾客承担。</view></view>
  <button class="primary-button save-settings" bindtap="saveSettings" disabled="{{unavailable || saving}}">保存设置</button>
  <view class="save-tip">下单按所选配送区域的跑腿费和起送价结算；默认值仅作店铺展示及未指定起送价时使用。</view>
  <view class="settings-card card">
    <view class="section-title">配送区域</view>
    <view wx:for="{{zones}}" wx:key="id" class="settings-row" bindtap="editZone" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view>{{item.campusName}} · {{item.zoneName}}<view class="settings-help">跑腿费 ¥{{item.feeText}} / 起送 ¥{{item.minText}} · {{item.enabled ? '启用' : '暂停'}}</view></view><text>编辑 ›</text></view>
    <button class="outline-button" bindtap="newZone" disabled="{{unavailable}}">新增区域</button>
    <view class="form-group"><view class="form-label">{{zoneForm.id ? '编辑区域' : '新区域'}} / 校区</view><input class="form-input" value="{{zoneForm.campusName}}" data-field="campusName" bindinput="onZoneInput" /></view>
    <view class="form-group"><view class="form-label">区域名称</view><input class="form-input" value="{{zoneForm.zoneName}}" data-field="zoneName" bindinput="onZoneInput" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><view class="form-group form-group--half"><view class="form-label">跑腿费（元）</view><input class="form-input" type="digit" value="{{zoneForm.deliveryFeeYuan}}" data-field="deliveryFeeYuan" bindinput="onZoneInput" /></view><view class="form-group form-group--half"><view class="form-label">起送价（元）</view><input class="form-input" type="digit" value="{{zoneForm.minGoodsAmountYuan}}" data-field="minGoodsAmountYuan" bindinput="onZoneInput" /></view></view>
    <view class="settings-row"><text>启用区域</text><switch checked="{{zoneForm.enabled}}" bindchange="onZoneEnabled" color="#2e6b4f" /></view>
    <button class="primary-button" bindtap="saveZone" disabled="{{saving || unavailable}}">保存区域</button>
  </view>
  <button class="outline-button" bindtap="loadLogs">查看最近100条操作日志</button>
  <view wx:for="{{logs}}" wx:key="_id" class="settings-card card"><view>{{item.action}} · {{item.timeText}}</view><view class="settings-help">操作人：{{item.operatorId}}</view><view class="settings-help">{{item.targetId || item.orderId}} {{item.detailText}}</view></view>
</view>
